# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# nba-prediction-model — public repo
# Code, docs and charts are tracked. Data, secrets and local state are not.
# Anything genuinely needed can be forced in with:  git add -f <path>
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# --- Secrets / credentials (public repo: keep this section first) ----------
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
secrets/
credentials.json
token.json
service-account*.json
*.pem
*.key
*.p12

